Description: Restore Chromium's native file chooser activation on X11
 Recognize Chromium's custom Open response, making Open the default and suggested
 action. Preserve folder navigation and block Enter/Space until initial held keys
 are released and the dialog has been visible for at least 500 milliseconds.
Author: Slax <build@slax.org>

